ue":"With the launch of the Gemini missions and the Apollo program, pressure on the wives grows."}]},{"id":86518,"number":8,"name":"Abort","plot":"Betty is forced to face a grim reality -- and plan for the future -- as she embarks on a battle for justice.","duration":42,"scws_id":289332,"season_id":6769,"created_at":"2025-02-20T02:53:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:38.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-20 03:53:06","images":[{"id":153015,"filename":"d05e070d-acee-48f1-b17b-afa7d334b807.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":86518,"created_at":"2025-02-20T02:53:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T02:53:06.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/d05e070d-acee-48f1-b17b-afa7d334b807.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":249230,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":86518,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"Abort"},{"id":249231,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":86518,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Betty is forced to face a grim reality -- and plan for the future -- as she embarks on a battle for justice."}]},{"id":86514,"number":9,"name":"The Dark Side","plot":"Jo redefines her role and priorities as Wally's career at NASA comes to an end; Louise worries about Alan as he considers a risky surgery that will determine his future; Susan is faced with uncertainty.","duration":42,"scws_id":289333,"season_id":6769,"created_at":"2025-02-20T02:46:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:40:38.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2025-02-20 03:46:11","images":[{"id":153006,"filename":"1edcbc25-8c18-4dfe-a31f-a09348c818b4.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":86514,"created_at":"2025-02-20T02:46:11.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T02:46:11.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/1edcbc25-8c18-4dfe-a31f-a093